{"4797910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "JAWED", "steam_appid": 4797910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4829600, 4829620], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/635a68c731eaeda35e09bd83542224c3.poster.avif?t=1787648501\" width=1170 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/635a68c731eaeda35e09bd83542224c3.webm?t=1787648501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/635a68c731eaeda35e09bd83542224c3.mp4?t=1787648501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>TRAPPED IN SILENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JAWED is what happens when you stay silent in the face of pain. Follow Adam as he processes the disappearance of his fiancée, Vivian, and the abyss he is pulled into when he discovers evidence that she might be alive. As Adam awakes to this life-shattering news, and a steel muzzle clamped to his face, he must accept that he is now trapped in silence until he can uncover the truth of what happened to the woman he once loved.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/630d79ae925f7dcdc69c0701deb7d4d2.poster.avif?t=1787648501\" width=1170 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/630d79ae925f7dcdc69c0701deb7d4d2.webm?t=1787648501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/630d79ae925f7dcdc69c0701deb7d4d2.mp4?t=1787648501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>UNNERVING IMMERSION</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every noise is handcrafted with purpose; every piece of music composed from meaning. JAWED is designed to make your claw into your chair with every pulsating note, creak and thump… but beware, the only thing worse is the silence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/31668e9a861635acbdf2b1e1a3d49006.poster.avif?t=1787648501\" width=1170 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/31668e9a861635acbdf2b1e1a3d49006.webm?t=1787648501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/31668e9a861635acbdf2b1e1a3d49006.mp4?t=1787648501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Adam’s self-imposed apartment prison and long for the dock he once loved exploring with Vivian. Explore each chapter’s unique darkness as you run, hide and fight the physical and mental shadows that threaten to lock you inside the abyss for eternity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/b71c318348039d01a040931ec6181a9e.poster.avif?t=1787648501\" width=1170 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/b71c318348039d01a040931ec6181a9e.webm?t=1787648501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/b71c318348039d01a040931ec6181a9e.mp4?t=1787648501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>EVERYTHING HAS MEANING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as the heart-breaking portrait of a broken relationship becomes clearer with every clue that is found. Every word, every detail, adds a new dimension to the bigger picture… but what really happened is for you to find out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/34d5704a29cf1f54522811cfd3b4971b.poster.avif?t=1787648501\" width=1170 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/34d5704a29cf1f54522811cfd3b4971b.webm?t=1787648501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/34d5704a29cf1f54522811cfd3b4971b.mp4?t=1787648501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/635a68c731eaeda35e09bd83542224c3.poster.avif?t=1787648501\" width=1170 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/635a68c731eaeda35e09bd83542224c3.webm?t=1787648501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/635a68c731eaeda35e09bd83542224c3.mp4?t=1787648501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>TRAPPED IN SILENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JAWED is what happens when you stay silent in the face of pain. Follow Adam as he processes the disappearance of his fiancée, Vivian, and the abyss he is pulled into when he discovers evidence that she might be alive. As Adam awakes to this life-shattering news, and a steel muzzle clamped to his face, he must accept that he is now trapped in silence until he can uncover the truth of what happened to the woman he once loved.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/630d79ae925f7dcdc69c0701deb7d4d2.poster.avif?t=1787648501\" width=1170 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/630d79ae925f7dcdc69c0701deb7d4d2.webm?t=1787648501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/630d79ae925f7dcdc69c0701deb7d4d2.mp4?t=1787648501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>UNNERVING IMMERSION</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every noise is handcrafted with purpose; every piece of music composed from meaning. JAWED is designed to make your claw into your chair with every pulsating note, creak and thump… but beware, the only thing worse is the silence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/31668e9a861635acbdf2b1e1a3d49006.poster.avif?t=1787648501\" width=1170 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/31668e9a861635acbdf2b1e1a3d49006.webm?t=1787648501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/31668e9a861635acbdf2b1e1a3d49006.mp4?t=1787648501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Adam’s self-imposed apartment prison and long for the dock he once loved exploring with Vivian. Explore each chapter’s unique darkness as you run, hide and fight the physical and mental shadows that threaten to lock you inside the abyss for eternity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/b71c318348039d01a040931ec6181a9e.poster.avif?t=1787648501\" width=1170 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/b71c318348039d01a040931ec6181a9e.webm?t=1787648501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/b71c318348039d01a040931ec6181a9e.mp4?t=1787648501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>EVERYTHING HAS MEANING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as the heart-breaking portrait of a broken relationship becomes clearer with every clue that is found. Every word, every detail, adds a new dimension to the bigger picture… but what really happened is for you to find out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/34d5704a29cf1f54522811cfd3b4971b.poster.avif?t=1787648501\" width=1170 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/34d5704a29cf1f54522811cfd3b4971b.webm?t=1787648501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797910/extras/34d5704a29cf1f54522811cfd3b4971b.mp4?t=1787648501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>", "short_description": "Jawed is a psychological horror game where you play as Adam, a man muzzled by a life of silent torture since the disappearance of his fiancée. Presented with evidence that she may be alive, Adam must confront their strained relationship and f